{"seq":2,"slug":"algorithms","title":"核心算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bev-perception","title":"BEV 感知与占用网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms/bev-perception","wordCount":1553,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"end-to-end-driving","title":"端到端自动驾驶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms/end-to-end-driving","wordCount":1607,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"planning-decision","title":"规划与决策算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms/planning-decision","wordCount":1418,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"核心算法\">核心算法</h1><p>本章深入自动驾驶的三大算法支柱：BEV 感知与 3D 占用网络如何构建对周围环境的统一理解、端到端神经网络如何将原始传感器输入直接映射为驾驶行为、以及规划决策算法如何在不确定环境中生成安全且舒适的轨迹。三篇文档从感知表征到行为输出，覆盖了 2025-2026 年最活跃的技术前沿。</p>\n"}